  "Content": {
    "Html": "<p><strong>Tomorrow is the last day to sign up for the final webinar in my 3-webinar series on fasting, that will take place on October 25 at 2pm ET (my birthday)!</strong> In this session, Fasting and Cancer, I will focus on fasting for cancer as both an adjunct to chemotherapy and as a potential treatment in and of itself. I will also cover fasting for detoxing from chemical pollutants and pros and cons of using VSED—voluntarily stopping eating and drinking—to take control of the end of your life. Read more about the webinar <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/webinar/fasting-cancer/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">here</a>. </p>\n<p><strong>To join the October 25 webinar: </strong>Make a donation through <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.z2systems.com/np/clients/nutritionfacts/donation.jsp?campaign=40&amp;&amp;test=true\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://nutritionfacts.z2systems.com/np/clients/nutritionfacts/donation.jsp?campaign=40&amp;&amp;test=true\">this form</a> and we will send you a link to register for the webinar. <strong>Registration for this third and final webinar closes at midnight on October 18.</strong></p>\n<p>The first two webinars are now available as digital downloads; get them here: <a href=\"https://drgreger.org/collections/downloads/products/fasting-weight-loss-digital\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://drgreger.org/collections/downloads/products/fasting-weight-loss-digital\">Fasting for Weight Loss (Intermittent Fasting)</a> and <a href=\"https://drgreger.org/collections/downloads/products/fasting-disease-reversal-digital\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://drgreger.org/collections/downloads/products/fasting-disease-reversal-digital\">Fasting for Disease Reversal</a>. </p>\n<h4 class=\"null\">Get the Preface for How Not to Diet</h4>\n<p><em><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/10/Preface-Mockup.png/\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\" wp-image-60978 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/10/Preface-Mockup.png\" alt=\"Preface\" width=\"200\" height=\"178\"/></a>How Not to Diet </em>is landing in less than two months, and I can’t wait for people to get their hands on this life-changing book. It was the single-biggest research project I’ve ever taken on, and I’m thrilled to give you a little sneak peek by offering the preface for download. Feel free to share this <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/book/how-not-to-diet/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">page</a> with friends and family so they can subscribe to get in on the fun. </p>\n<p>I also recently sat down to chat about the book with Plant-Based News, and you can see that interview <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UUUB_DyH6ww\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UUUB_DyH6ww\">here</a>. </p>\n<h4 class=\"null\">Help Educate Medical Students</h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/02/Dr-Klaper-1.png/\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\" wp-image-57833 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/02/Dr-Klaper-1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"201\" height=\"87\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/02/Dr-Klaper-1.png 650w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/02/Dr-Klaper-1-540x234.png 540w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 201px) 100vw, 201px\"/></a>Ever wish medical students could be exposed to evidence-based nutrition? With your help they can! <a href=\"https://www.doctorklaper.com/moving-medicine-forward\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://www.doctorklaper.com/moving-medicine-forward\">Donate to support</a> Dr. Klaper’s quest to speak at all of the medical schools and inform an entire new generation of doctors. He’s one of my heroes!</p>\n<div> </div>\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<h4 class=\"null\">How Not to Die Talk on Prime</h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/10/HNTD-3x4-Amazon.png/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\" wp-image-61019 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/10/HNTD-3x4-Amazon-1024x1365.png\" alt=\"HNTD talk\" width=\"200\" height=\"267\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/10/HNTD-3x4-Amazon-1024x1365.png 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/10/HNTD-3x4-Amazon-960x1280.png 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/10/HNTD-3x4-Amazon-768x1024.png 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/10/HNTD-3x4-Amazon.png 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/10/HNTD-3x4-Amazon-720x960.png 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/10/HNTD-3x4-Amazon-540x720.png 540w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/></a>My 2016 presentation, How Not to Die: The Role of Diet in Preventing, Arresting, &amp; Reversing Our Top 15 Killers, is now available on <a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/How-Not-Die-Michael-Greger/dp/B07Z44TYQG/ref=sr_1_1?crid=3RATV3P3TG211&amp;keywords=how+not+to+die&amp;qid=1571152123&amp;s=instant-video&amp;sprefix=%2Cinstant-video%2C137&amp;sr=1-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://www.amazon.com/How-Not-Die-Michael-Greger/dp/B07Z44TYQG/ref=sr_1_1?crid=3RATV3P3TG211&amp;keywords=how+not+to+die&amp;qid=1571152123&amp;s=instant-video&amp;sprefix=%2Cinstant-video%2C137&amp;sr=1-1\">Amazon Prime</a>, free to watch with Prime membership in the US and UK. I’m excited for the opportunity to reach even more people through this platform. </p></div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-60211 aligncenter\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month-1024x331.png\" alt=\"Top 3 Videos of the Month\" width=\"516\" height=\"167\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month-1024x331.png 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month-960x310.png 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month-768x248.png 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month-720x233.png 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month-540x174.png 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month.png 1108w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 516px) 100vw, 516px\"/></div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/10/Dec14-Egg-Industry-Response-to-Choline-and-TMAO.jpeg/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-large wp-image-60983 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/10/Dec14-Egg-Industry-Response-to-Choline-and-TMAO-1024x576.jpeg\" alt=\"Egg Industry Response to Choline and TMAO\" width=\"356\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/10/Dec14-Egg-Industry-Response-to-Choline-and-TMAO-1024x576.jpeg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/10/Dec14-Egg-Industry-Response-to-Choline-and-TMAO-960x540.jpeg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/10/Dec14-Egg-Industry-Response-to-Choline-and-TMAO-768x432.jpeg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/10/Dec14-Egg-Industry-Response-to-Choline-and-TMAO-480x270.jpeg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/10/Dec14-Egg-Industry-Response-to-Choline-and-TMAO-1200x675.jpeg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/10/Dec14-Egg-Industry-Response-to-Choline-and-TMAO-720x405.jpeg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/10/Dec14-Egg-Industry-Response-to-Choline-and-TMAO-540x304.jpeg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/10/Dec14-Egg-Industry-Response-to-Choline-and-TMAO.jpeg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 356px) 100vw, 356px\"/></a></div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/egg-industry-response-to-choline-and-tmao/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Egg Industry Response to Choline &amp; TMAO</a><p></p>\n<p>How the egg industry funded a study designed to cover up the toxic trimethylamine oxide reaction to egg consumption.</p></div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/10/Are-Keto-Diets-Safe-1.png/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-large wp-image-60985 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/10/Are-Keto-Diets-Safe-1-1024x576.png\" alt=\"Are Keto Diets Safe?\" width=\"356\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/10/Are-Keto-Diets-Safe-1-1024x576.png 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/10/Are-Keto-Diets-Safe-1-960x540.png 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/10/Are-Keto-Diets-Safe-1-768x432.png 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/10/Are-Keto-Diets-Safe-1-480x270.png 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/10/Are-Keto-Diets-Safe-1-1200x675.png 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/10/Are-Keto-Diets-Safe-1-720x405.png 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/10/Are-Keto-Diets-Safe-1-540x304.png 540w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 356px) 100vw, 356px\"/></a><p></p>\n</div>\n<p><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/are-keto-diets-safe/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Are Keto Diets Safe?</a> </p>\n<p>The effects of ketogenic diets on nutrient sufficiency, gut flora, and heart disease risk.</p>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/10/48-02.jpg/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-large wp-image-60987 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/10/48-02-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"The 3,500 Calorie per Pound Rule Is Wrong\" width=\"356\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/10/48-02-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/10/48-02-960x540.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/10/48-02-768x432.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/10/48-02-480x270.jpg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/10/48-02-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/10/48-02-720x405.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/10/48-02-540x304.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/10/48-02.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 356px) 100vw, 356px\"/></a></div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/the-3500-calorie-per-pound-rule-is-wrong/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">The 3,500 Calorie per Pound Rule Is Wrong</a><p></p>\n<p>How many fewer calories do you have to eat every day to lose one pound of body fat?</p></div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>\n<h4 class=\"null\">Live Q&amp;As October 24 – CANCELLED</h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square.png/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\" wp-image-53879 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-1024x1024.png\" alt=\"Live Q&amp;A\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-960x960.png 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-768x768.png 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-500x500.png 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-1200x1200.png 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-720x720.png 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-540x540.png 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square.png 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/></a>Unfortunately, I have to cancel this month’s scheduled Q&amp;As. Apologies, and see you on November 27.</p></div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>Every month now I do Q&amp;As live from my treadmill, and <em><strong>Nov 27</strong></em> is the day.<p></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Facebook Live</strong>: At 12:00 p.m. ET, go to our <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/NutritionFacts.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://www.facebook.com/NutritionFacts.org/\">Facebook page</a> to watch live and ask questions.</li>\n<li><strong>YouTube Live Stream: </strong>At 1:00 p.m. ET go <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/c/NutritionfactsOrgMD\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://www.youtube.com/c/NutritionfactsOrgMD\">here</a> to watch live and ask even more questions! </li>\n</ul>\n<p>You can now find links to all of my past live YouTube and Facebook Q&amp;As right <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/live/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">here</a> on NutritionFacts.org. If that’s not enough, remember I have an audio podcast to keep you company at <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/audio/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://nutritionfacts.org/audio.</a></p></div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<p>In health,<br/>\n<b>Michael Greger, M.D.</b></p>\n<p>PS: If you haven’t yet, you can subscribe to my free videos <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/subscribe/\"><b>here</b></a><b> </b>and watch my live, year-in-review presentations:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>2012: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/uprooting-the-leading-causes-of-death/\"><u><b>Uprooting the Leading Causes of Death</b></u></a></li>\n<li>2013: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/more-than-an-apple-a-day-preventing-our-most-common-diseases/\"><u><b>More Than an Apple a Day</b></u></a></li>\n<li>2014: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/from-table-to-able/\"><u><b>From Table to Able: Combating Disabling Diseases with Food</b></u></a></li>\n<li>2015: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/food-as-medicine/\"><u><b>Food as Medicine: Preventing and Treating the Most Dreaded Diseases with Diet</b></u></a></li>\n<li>2016: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/how-not-to-die/\"><u><b>How Not To Die: The Role of Diet in Preventing, Arresting, and Reversing Our Top 15 Killers</b></u></a></li>\n</ul>"
